    <item>
      <title>Helm configuration</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/helm/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/helm/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;helm-configuration-parameters&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Helm configuration parameters&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/helm/#helm-configuration-parameters&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Helm configuration parameters&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Helm configuration parameters&#34; href=&#34;#helm-configuration-parameters&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Uitsmijter is best to install over &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://helm.sh&#34;&#xA;&gt;helm&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;helm repo add uitsmijter https://charts.uitsmijter.io/&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;helm update&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To list available versions run:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;helm search repo uitsmijter&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;To see a list with release candidates included:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-shell&#34; data-lang=&#34;shell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;helm search repo uitsmijter --devel&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The complete &lt;code&gt;Values.yaml&lt;/code&gt; is presented first, than the parameters are described as on overview. For detailed&#xA;information please read the &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/general/quickstart&#34;&#xA;&gt;quick start&lt;/a&gt; guide.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Entities</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/entities/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/entities/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;entities&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Entities&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/entities/#entities&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Entities&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Entities&#34; href=&#34;#entities&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This document describes the different entities Uitsmijter uses internally.&#xA;They are mentioned throughout the rest of the documentation.&#xA;For a complete list of used terminology, see &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/general/terminology&#34;&#xA;&gt;Terminology&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;tenant&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Tenant&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/entities/#tenant&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Tenant&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Tenant&#34; href=&#34;#tenant&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A tenant is the highest order entity in the system. Every tenant is isolated in its functions and can not share&#xA;resources.&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Every Tenant does have its own set of settings, providers and clients. Let&amp;rsquo;s have a look what this means in practice.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tenant and client configuration</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_client_config/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_client_config/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;tenant-and-client-configuration&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Tenant and client configuration&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_client_config/#tenant-and-client-configuration&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Tenant and client configuration&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Tenant and client configuration&#34; href=&#34;#tenant-and-client-configuration&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Uitsmijter&amp;rsquo;s goal is to offer you a login solution that can be adapted to your needs in the best possible way without&#xA;prescribing the architecture of the user interface, and that can be implemented extremely elegantly and quickly.&#xA;In order to set up a new system with Uitsmijter or to integrate Uitsmijter into an existing system, settings are&#xA;necessary that describe the desired system landscape and the surrounding environment.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Logging</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/logging/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/logging/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;logging&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Logging&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/logging/#logging&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Logging&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Logging&#34; href=&#34;#logging&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The Uitsmijter authorisation server logs in different levels and formats. As default, it logs in &lt;code&gt;INFO&lt;/code&gt; and plain&#xA;strings onto the&#xA;console but ndjson format is also supported.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The default might change in the future because ndjson is more commonly used.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;setting-the-level&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Setting the level&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/logging/#setting-the-level&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Setting the level&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Setting the level&#34; href=&#34;#setting-the-level&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following levels are available:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>JWT Signing Algorithms</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/jwt_algorithms/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/jwt_algorithms/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;jwt-signing-algorithms&#34;&gt;&#xA;        JWT Signing Algorithms&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/jwt_algorithms/#jwt-signing-algorithms&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: JWT Signing Algorithms&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: JWT Signing Algorithms&#34; href=&#34;#jwt-signing-algorithms&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Uitsmijter supports two JWT signing algorithms for access tokens: &lt;strong&gt;HS256&lt;/strong&gt; (HMAC with SHA-256) and &lt;strong&gt;RS256&lt;/strong&gt; (RSA with SHA-256). This guide explains the differences between these algorithms and how to migrate from HS256 to RS256.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;algorithm-comparison&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Algorithm Comparison&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/jwt_algorithms/#algorithm-comparison&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Algorithm Comparison&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Algorithm Comparison&#34; href=&#34;#algorithm-comparison&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Feature&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;HS256 (Symmetric)&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;RS256 (Asymmetric)&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Shared secret (single key)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;RSA key pair (public + private)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Good (if secret is protected)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Better&lt;/strong&gt; (private key never shared)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Distribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Secret must be shared securely&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Public key can be distributed openly&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Token Verification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Requires shared secret&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Uses public key (via JWKS)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Rotation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Requires secret update everywhere&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seamless&lt;/strong&gt; (JWKS supports multiple keys)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Faster (symmetric crypto)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Slightly slower (asymmetric crypto)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Case&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Simple deployments, testing&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production, microservices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JWKS Endpoint&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Not used&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;/.well-known/jwks.json&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Yes (backward compatibility)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Recommended for new deployments&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;hs256-hmac-with-sha-256&#34;&gt;&#xA;        HS256 (HMAC with SHA-256)&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/jwt_algorithms/#hs256-hmac-with-sha-256&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: HS256 (HMAC with SHA-256)&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: HS256 (HMAC with SHA-256)&#34; href=&#34;#hs256-hmac-with-sha-256&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;HS256 is a symmetric algorithm that uses a shared secret key to both sign and verify JWTs.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Migrating to Per-Tenant JWT Algorithms</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_algorithm_migration/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_algorithm_migration/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;migrating-to-per-tenant-jwt-algorithms&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Migrating to Per-Tenant JWT Algorithms&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_algorithm_migration/#migrating-to-per-tenant-jwt-algorithms&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Migrating to Per-Tenant JWT Algorithms&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Migrating to Per-Tenant JWT Algorithms&#34; href=&#34;#migrating-to-per-tenant-jwt-algorithms&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This guide helps you migrate from global JWT algorithm configuration to per-tenant configuration.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Overview&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration/tenant_algorithm_migration/#overview&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Overview&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Uitsmijter supports per-tenant JWT algorithm selection, allowing different tenants to use HS256 or RS256 independently. This enables:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
